,"user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-01-22T03:02:39Z","updated_at":"2026-01-22T10:12:48Z","closed_at":"2026-01-22T10:12:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproduced in: Godot 4.5.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS 15.2, Apple Silicon (M1)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen opening a project created with an earlier Godot version (e.g., 4.3 or 4.4) in Godot 4.5, the automatic export preset migration introduces a typo in the privacy collected data property name:\n\n- `search_history` is incorrectly changed to `search_hhistory` (double 'h')\n\nAdditionally, the correct `search_history` property is added as a duplicate at the end of the preset section, resulting in both the typo version and correct version existing in the file.\n\nThis affects both **macOS** and **iOS** export presets.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThe property name should remain `search_history` (matching the source code in `platform/macos/export/export_plugin.cpp` and `platform/ios/export/export_plugin.cpp` which maps to `NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeSearchHistory`).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create an export preset with macOS or iOS platform in Godot 4.3 or 4.4\n2. Open the project in Godot 4.5\n3. Check `export_presets.cfg` file\n\n### Observed changes in export_presets.cfg\n\n```diff\n# Existing correct spelling changed to typo\n-privacy/collected_data/search_history/collected=false\n-privacy/collected_data/search_history/linked_to_user=false\n-privacy/collected_data/search_history/used_for_tracking=false\n-privacy/collected_data/search_history/collection_purposes=0\n+privacy/collected_data/search_hhistory/collected=false\n+privacy/collected_data/search_hhistory/linked_to_user=false\n+privacy/collected_data/search_hhistory/used_for_tracking=false\n+privacy/collected_data/search_hhistory/collection_purposes=0\n\n# Duplicate with correct spelling added at end of preset\n+privacy/collected_data/search_history/collected=false\n+privacy/collected_data/search_history/linked_to_user=false\n+privacy/collected_data/search_history/used_for_tracking=false\n+privacy/collected_data/search_history/collection_purposes=0\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A - Can be reproduced by opening any project with macOS/iOS export presets from Godot 4.3/4.4 in Godot 4.5.","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115237/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.g